Boss and superunique areas, and the verification data
  The areas of the bosses and three superuniques in js/core/sources.js, and
  tests/fixtures/silospen-areas.json, are facts read from silospen/DropCalc,
  https://github.com/silospen/DropCalc , commit 73d31110aaec7a5a6efcbaa403dd1e781980d701,
  src/main/kotlin/com/silospen/dropcalc/areas/HardcodedAreas.kt. The tests also read DropCalc's
  copy of the .txt tables and its expected results (pinned in tools/sources.json, downloaded into
  tools/.cache, never shipped). tests/lib/silospen-compat.mjs restates DropCalc's published method
  in order to reproduce its expected results; no DropCalc code is included.

  DropCalc is distributed under the MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 silospen, with the same terms
  as quoted above. That license covers DropCalc's own work; the .txt tables it ships are Blizzard's
  game data, and this repository does not include them.

